{"id":"00057","root":"uni00057_1","name":{"ja":"NO.16ソニア","en":"No. 16 Sonia"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"NO.16ソニア","en":"No. 16 Sonia"},"aliases":["NO. 16 Sonia"],"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-11-30","limited":true,"characterId":50,"profile":{"ja":"人魔問わず切り殺した殺人鬼として米連国内で恐れられた人物。この殺人鬼は残虐非道で米連内では知らない人はいない位であり、その残虐さから、捜査チームには犯人は魔族だと目されていたほどで、捕まるまでに１００人以上の人魔が惨殺されたのであった。その正体は教師をしていたソニアであり、捕まった時も血しぶきを浴びている姿を米連内に放映された。その後裁判が行われ、彼女は死刑になった。だがそれは表向きで、彼女の才能に目をつけた米連の研究者が取引を持ち掛け彼女は生きる為にその取引にのる。そして彼女は研究者に身体を弄られ人造人間として生まれ変わった。その後彼女は裏の世界に足を踏み入れ、裏の住人として米連に仇なす魔族や人を切り殺している。","en":"No. 16 Sonia is a murderous serial killer feared across the United States for slashing both humans and demons alike. Her brutality was so notorious that virtually everyone in the country knew her name, and investigators even suspected the culprit to be a demon because of the sheer savagery. Over a hundred humans and demons were gruesomely slain before she was captured. Her true identity was that of a teacher named Sonia, and footage of her drenched in blood was broadcast nationwide upon her arrest. After a trial she was sentenced to death, but that was merely a façade. Researchers in the United States, impressed by her talent, offered her a deal, which she accepted to survive. They experimented on her body, rebirthing her as a synthetic being. She then stepped into the underworld, where, as a resident of the shadows, she continues to cut down demons and humans who threaten the United States."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"蒼桐かこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00057_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1024,2048],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[131,262],"def":[113,226],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","60001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00057_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1548,3096],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[197,394],"def":[